# Step-by-Step Mode

When the user says "step by step":
- Provide exactly ONE step per message
- Each step must include:
  • Exact Unity menu path (where to click)
  • Exact folder path and file name (if creating/editing files)
  • Exact full code to paste (if applicable)
  • Expected observable result in editor or play mode
- End every message with: Reply 'done' when finished
- Do NOT include future steps or previews
- Do NOT ask clarifying questions unless absolutely blocking
